.TH ALX-UPDATE 8 "November 2026" "Algothix OS 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
alx-update \- AC-power and idle-aware system updater for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B alx-update
[\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B alx-update
wraps \fBapt-get update\fR and \fBapt-get full-upgrade\fR, running only when
the machine is connected to AC power (or has no battery) and 1-minute CPU load
is below 75% of available cores. Can be run manually or enabled via
\fBsystemctl enable --now alx-update.timer\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Run AC-power and idle checks and preview the update without modifying packages.
.TP
.B \-\-force
Bypass AC-power and idle-load guards.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Display version information.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display usage information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR alx-setup (1),
.BR alx-doctor (1)
